                <pb facs="0955" n="843" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg843"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 892.001/4.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Chargé
                    Tarler.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-10-25"><hi rendition="#italic">October 25,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President has telegraphed his sympathy to His Majesty King Maha Vajiravudh.
                    Express to minister of foreign affairs sympathy of the Secretary of State.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
